---
import DcsPublicLayout from '../../layouts/DcsPublicLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/dcs-auth.css';
export const prerender=false;
---
<DcsPublicLayout page="checkout" title="Check your email | Deck Creator Studio" description="Confirm your Studio account or return to sign in." metaRobots="noindex, nofollow">
 <div class="page-inner dcs-auth"><section class="auth-card" aria-labelledby="auth-heading">
  <p class="auth-kicker">Tides of Knowing · Deck Creator Studio</p><h1 id="auth-heading">Check your email</h1>
  <p>If your request was accepted, look for the account confirmation, sign-in or password reset message you requested. Open its link to continue. This page does not confirm delivery.</p>
  <p>Check your spam or junk folder too. Email links expire and can be used once; request a fresh message if the link no longer works.</p>
  <p><a href="/auth/confirm-email/">Request a fresh account confirmation</a></p><p><a href="/auth/login/?redirectTo=%2Fstudio%2F">Return to sign in</a></p>
  <p>Need help? <a href="mailto:hello@tidesofknowing.com">hello@tidesofknowing.com</a></p>
 </section></div>
</DcsPublicLayout>
